==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[DL Anniv. Doge Cake|110M DL Anniv. Doge Cake]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~33.33 seconds<sup>60f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

